"标题不超过 12 个字。\n描述一句话，40 字以内：写主体和内容，图像类再写风格、色彩和氛围。\n标签 6 到 10 个，覆盖主体、题材、风格、色彩、情绪；只写这件东西本身有的，不猜它能拿来做什么。\n长文和文档概括它在讲什么，而不是描述排版。" = "Title: at most 6 words.\nCaption: one sentence, under 20 words, on the subject and content; for images, also the style, colors, and mood.\nTags: 6 to 10, covering subject, theme, style, color, and mood; only what the item itself has, not what it could be used for.\nFor long articles and documents, say what they are about rather than describing the layout.";
"写 3 到 5 条，让人不看原文也能拿到主要信息。\n每条一句，写具体的事实、观点、数字；不写「介绍了」「讨论了」这种转述。" = "3 to 5 points that give the main information without reading the original.\nOne sentence each, with concrete facts, claims, and numbers; no \"it introduces\" or \"it discusses\".";
"像聊天一样自然、简洁，一般两三段以内；内容本来就是并列的几项时才用列表。\n用户讲自己的经历和想法，直接接着聊，不用去卡片里找证据，也不用为卡片里没有而道歉。" = "Natural and brief, like a chat, usually two or three paragraphs at most; use a list only when the content is a set of parallel items.\nWhen the user talks about their own experiences and ideas, just carry on; no need to look for evidence in the cards or apologize when the cards don't cover it.";
"指向具体的卡片和细节，不超过 200 字。" = "Point to specific cards and details, in under 100 words.";
"从这张卡的具体细节出发，回应用户这句话，不写空话。三到五句，不超过 150 字。" = "Start from this card's specific details and respond to what the user said, with no filler. Three to five sentences, under 75 words.";

